resposta:
Prontinho! Criei um site completo em **um único arquivo HTML** (com CSS e JS embutidos), bonito e moderno, com todas as funcionalidades que você pediu. O nome escolhido foi **"Super Retirador de Texto Paps"** — mantendo a marca **Paps** com um toque divertido. 👇

## Como usar
1. Copie o código abaixo, cole em um Bloco de Notas e salve como **`super-retirador-paps.html`**
2. Abra no Chrome/Edge/Firefox (funciona **offline**, sem internet)
3. Cole seu texto no campo grande, digite os padrões/símbolos que quer remover nos 5 campos e clique em **🧹 Limpar**
4. Acompanhe as contagens sendo feitas e, no fim, use **📋 Copiar!**

---

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Super Retirador de Texto Paps: remova palavras, pontuação, símbolos e caracteres do seu texto de uma só vez. Interface simples e rápida!">
<title>Super Retirador de Texto Paps — Elimine textos e símbolos rapidinho</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SUPER RETIRADOR DE TEXTO PAPS │ Estilo
     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-moz-text-size-adjust:100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
  body{
    margin:0;min-height:100dvh;font-family:'Poppins',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    color:var(--txt);line-height:1.6;cursor:text;
    background:
      linear-gradient(158deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2)),
      radial-gradient(600px 460px 52% at 6% 100%, rgba(0,201,168,.09), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(820px 540px 50% at 94% -10%, rgba(123,95,255,.15), transparent 60%);
    background-size:cover;
    animation:gradear 16s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes gradear{
    0%   { background-position:0 0; }
    100% { background-position:200% 130%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ body{animation:none} }
  ::selection{background:rgba(123,95,255,.42);color:#fff}

  /* Variáveis de tema */
  :root{
    --bg1:#0b0e16; --bg2:#162035;
    --card:#172033; --card2:#1e2c40; --limite:#2a374a; --limite-borda:#2d394c;
    --txt:#e6eaf0; --muted:#9ab0c6;
    --glow:#7b5ffa; --ring:#a29bfe; --ombra:0 14px 46px rgba(0,0,0,.52); --rn:18px;
  }
  .light-mode{
    --bg1:#eceef3; --bg2:#dfe8f6;
    --card:#fff; --card2:#f2f6fb; --limite:#d6dee8; --limite-borda:#cdbfe2;
    --txt:#182437; --muted:#5d6b7e;
    --glow:#6c5ce7; --ring:#6c5ce7; --ombra:0 8px 22px rgba(24,36,55,.08);
  }

  /* Layout geral */
  .app{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 50px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}
  .hero{padding:24px 0 8px;text-align:left}
  .row-titulo{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4.7vw,2.6rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 8px;
    background:var(--accent);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .tagline{max-width:740px;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(.92rem,1.5vw,1rem)}
  .trocar-tema{
    position:relative;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--limite-borda);background:var(--card);
    color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-size:.85rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    transition:.25s all;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }
  .trocar-tema:hover{transform:scale(1.08);border-color:var(--glow);background:rgba(123,95,255,.16);color:#fff}
  .trocar-tema:active{transform:scale(.93)}

  /* Formulário */
  .sec-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
  .caixa-entrada{position:relative;flex:1 1 540px;min-height:92px}
  .caixa-entrada .rotulo{
    position:absolute;top:11px;left:12px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);opacity:.85;pointer-events:none;
  }
  #txtEntrada{
    width:100%;max-width:560px;appearance:none;background:var(--card);
    border:1.5px solid var(--limite-borda);border-radius:var(--rn);
    color:var(--txt);font:inherit;padding:12px 13px;
    resize:vertical;overflow:hidden;line-height:1.45;min-height:92px;
    transition:border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s;
  }
  #txtEntrada:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(162,155,255,.16)}
  #txtEntrada::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;height:6px}
  #txtEntrada::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:3px}
  .hint-abre{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:12px;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted);opacity:.75;pointer-events:none;word-break:break-all}
  .grid-passo{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .passo{
    flex:0 0 auto;min-width:192px;
    background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--limite-borda);
    border-radius:var(--rn);padding:13px 11px 10px;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;
    transition:border-color .3s,transform .2s,box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .passo:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.34)}
  .numero-passo{
    flex:none;margin-right:7px;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(123,95,255,.15);border:1.5px solid rgba(123,95,255,.45);
    color:var(--glow);font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;
  }
  .passo .num{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(123,95,255,.15);border:1.5px solid rgba(123,95,255,.45);
    color:#fff;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;flex:none;margin-right:8px;
  }
  .passo .nome{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .passo .extra{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}
  .passo .exemp{font-size:.64rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;word-break:keep-all}
  .badge-pn{
    flex:none;margin-right:auto;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(162,155,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(162,155,255,.42);
    color:#cdd5ff;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700;
    opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.2s all;
  }
  .in-step.has-badge .badge-pn{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
  .in-step.no-badge .badge-pn{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:scale(.5)}
  .in-step{
    width:100%;appearance:none;background:var(--card);
    border:1.5px solid var(--limite-borda);
    border-radius:calc(var(--rn)-4px);
    color:var(--txt);font:inherit;padding:10px 12px;
    resize:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1.4;min-height:44px;
    transition:border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .in-step:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(162,155,255,.15)}

  /* Ações */
  .acoes{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0}
  .botao{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
    padding:11px 19px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;color:#fff;
    border:none;border-radius:var(--rn);background:var(--accent);
    cursor:pointer;transition:.22s all;white-space:nowrap;
    box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(123,95,255,.38);
  }
  .botao:hover:not(:disabled){transform:scale(1.02);filter:brightness(1.08);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(123,95,255,.55)}
  .botao:active{transform:scale(.98);filter:brightness(.95)}
  .botao:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait;transform:none;filter:brightness(1)}
  .botao.zerar{background:transparent;border:2px solid var(--glow);color:var(--glow);box-shadow:none}
  .botao.zerar:hover:not(:disabled){background:rgba(123,95,255,.08);transform:scale(1.02)}
  .ativando .spi{
    display:inline-block;width:15px;height:15px;border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    border-top-color:#fff;border-radius:50%;animation:giro .75s linear infinite;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:middle;flex:none;
  }
  @keyframes giro{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .aviso-xs{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-left:10px;flex:none;white-space:nowrap}

  /* Resultado */
  .sec-resumo{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--limite-borda);
    border-left:5px solid var(--glow);border-radius:var(--rn);
    padding:18px 22px 18px;box-shadow:var(--ombra);position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .sec-resumo::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 0%,rgba(123,95,255,.04) 45%,rgba(123,95,255,.22) 100%);
